Subject: [PATCH] patch: 0445-sweet-hid-trackpad.patch - macOS touch screen as a real
 trackpad (sweettouchrel=2, the new default): one finger moves the pointer by relative motion
 (light acceleration), tap = left click (after a 250 ms double-tap window), tap then touch-and-move
 = drag, tap tap = double click, two-finger tap = right click, two-finger drag = scroll;
 sweettouchrel=1 keeps 0397's direct touch

S3z2 2026-11-13: the menu bar is on the panel; the user asked for the touch screen to work like a
trackpad instead of the pointer jumping under the finger. Applies on 0444 (seq-12377 line).
Kernel seq1p = seq1o + this; seq1q: tap-then-drag needs 30 px (S3z3: 11 px of jitter on a second tap started a drag).
